<div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-brandBlue uppercase italic mb-6">3. Cztery modele z naszej linii</h2>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Linia power banków do laptopów obejmuje cztery modele. Różnią się mocą, pojemnością i liczbą portów, a nie tylko obudową.</p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl mb-6"><table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse border border-slate-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden"><thead><tr class="bg-brandBlue text-white text-badge font-black uppercase tracking-widest"><th class="p-4 text-left">Model</th><th class="p-4 text-left">Pojemność / energia</th><th class="p-4 text-left">Moc maks.</th><th class="p-4 text-left">Porty</th><th class="p-4 text-left">Zastosowanie</th></tr></thead><tbody class="text-slate-600"><tr class="border-b border-slate-100"><td class="p-4">WOPB20</td><td class="p-4">20 000 mAh</td><td class="p-4">65 W PD</td><td class="p-4">2× USB-C (w tym kabel), Lightning, USB-A</td><td class="p-4">MacBook Air, XPS 13, ThinkPad</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-slate-100"><td class="p-4">WOP21</td><td class="p-4">20 000 mAh / 74 Wh</td><td class="p-4">67 W PD</td><td class="p-4">2× USB-C, USB-A</td><td class="p-4">MacBook Pro 14, XPS 13/14</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-slate-100"><td class="p-4">WOP22</td><td class="p-4">20 000 mAh / 72 Wh</td><td class="p-4">130 W łącznie (65 W + 65 W)</td><td class="p-4">2× USB-C, USB-A</td><td class="p-4">dwa laptopy jednocześnie</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-slate-100"><td class="p-4">WOP23</td><td class="p-4">27 000 mAh / 97,2 Wh</td><td class="p-4">240 W łącznie (100 W port + 140 W kabel)</td><td class="p-4">2× USB-C (w tym kabel EPR), USB-A</td><td class="p-4">MacBook Pro 16, XPS 15/16, gaming</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
